     mapping, the preview, the result, and a backup file added to the passwords here. Every name starts
     with import_. "Import" is glossary item 101, "File" 105, "Choose file" 106, "Backup (a file)" 97.
     Names of other apps and formats are not translated: Google Password Manager, Chrome, Bitwarden,
     KeePass, KeePassXC, Firefox, Excel, CSV, JSON, UTF-8, UTF-16, Windows-1251, and file names. -->
